~C. Report a number without explaining what it means in the situation. #This is not the best answer. It skips a required modeling, calculation, unit, or interpretation step needed to meet the lesson standard.
~D. Choose the largest number without checking what it represents. #This is not the best answer. It skips a required modeling, calculation, unit, or interpretation step needed to meet the lesson standard.
}

